# Full 8 MB SPI-flash reads of the XM25QH64D. Not committed: they are the
# vendor's proprietary firmware image, and are reproducible by dumping the
# flash on any SC49 unit (see README). The carved/unpacked analysis under
# dump/carve/ IS tracked — this only ignores the raw top-level images.
dump/*.bin

# Local secrets — real Wi-Fi credentials etc. Copy the *.template files,
# fill them in, and keep the real ones out of git.
dump/sd_artifacts/custom/configs/secrets.conf
dump/sd_artifacts/_ak39_factory.ini
